thoughtrecipe critic_revise
"Critic revise fires on scratch-rendered issues and re-critiques."

agent reviewer uses critic
agent fixer uses react

run reviewer:
  critique "Judge correctness, error handling, and naming."
  revise when scratch.critic.verdict contains issues:
    delegate to fixer:
      goal "Address the issues found by the critique."
  capture revisions -> state.critic_revisions
